OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'incredibly loved' man
OL,4,Aafter stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who was fatally
OL,7,Fstabbed outside his house said he was
OL,8,F"incredibly loved by the whole
OL,9,Fcommunity".
OL,11,FZeshaan Shaukat, 34, died in hospital
OL,12,Fon Friday, three days after being
OL,13,Fattacked on Ashville Avenue, Hodge
OL,14,FHill, Birmingham, police said.
OL,16,F"Losing him so suddenly and tragically
OL,17,Fis something we cannot begin to
OL,18,Fdescribe," said his family in a
OL,19,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
