OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'incredibly loved' man
OL,4,Aafter stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Police said it had
OL,7,Farrested seven people, including two
OL,8,Fwho remained in custody on suspicion of
OL,9,Fmurder and a third person held on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender.
